      "reason": "The work is deciding whether the complaint that “pay rate per shift” is undefined identifies the shifts-versus-wages uncertainty the court construed, or merely uncertainty about the payment rate. The bargaining-unit, office-cap, and old-delinquency objections are plainly separable, but quoting the formula does not settle what problem the description attributes to it."
