      "reason": "The reviewer must check whether Section 22-D Point Two(vi)'s “benefit credits” establish a contribution obligation, then compare the asserted conflict with the court's treatment of compensated unworked time under Section 13-K.3. Even after that check, judgment is needed about whether this different cross-provision example names the same “shifts worked” ambiguity or a distinct benefit-credit dispute."
